{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "campus-trade-api-v2",
    "name": "Campus Trade API - Backend 06",
    "description": "校园二手交易平台后端 API 完整测试集合 - 2026-04-14 更新版本",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. 认证模块 (Auth)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 用户注册",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"测试用户\",\n  \"email\": \"test@campustrade.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"phone\": \"13900139000\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "注册新用户账号\n\n**请求参数：**\n- username: 用户名（必填）\n- email: 邮箱（必填，唯一）\n- password: 密码（必填，至少8位，包含大小写字母和数字）\n- phone: 手机号（必填）\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 201\n- data.token: JWT Token\n- data.user: 用户信息"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 用户登录（邮箱）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// 自动保存 Token 到环境变量",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('TOKEN', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "        console.log('Token 已保存:', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"user1@campustrade.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "使用邮箱或用户名登录\n\n**请求参数：**\n- username: 邮箱或用户名\n- password: 密码\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 200\n- data.token: JWT Token（有效期7天）\n- data.user: 用户信息\n\n**测试账号：**\n- 邮箱: user1@campustrade.com\n- 密码: Password123!"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 获取当前用户信息",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "获取当前登录用户的详细信息\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**响应：**\n- id: 用户ID\n- email: 邮箱\n- username: 用户名\n- avatar: 头像URL\n- phone: 手机号\n- createdAt: 注册时间"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "用户认证相关接口，包括注册、登录、获取用户信息"
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 商品模块 (Products)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 获取商品列表",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/products?page=1&pageSize=10&status=available&category=数码&sort=createdAt&order=DESC",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "页码（默认1）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "每页数量（默认10）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "available",
                  "description": "商品状态：available/sold/deleted"
                },
                {
                  "key": "category",
                  "value": "数码",
                  "description": "商品分类（可选）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "createdAt",
                  "description": "排序字段：createdAt/price"
                },
                {
                  "key": "order",
                  "value": "DESC",
                  "description": "排序方式：ASC/DESC"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取商品列表，支持分页、筛选、排序\n\n**查询参数：**\n- page: 页码（默认1）\n- pageSize: 每页数量（默认10）\n- status: 商品状态（available/sold/deleted）\n- category: 商品分类\n- condition: 商品成色（new/like_new/good/fair）\n- minPrice: 最低价格\n- maxPrice: 最高价格\n- sort: 排序字段（createdAt/price）\n- order: 排序方式（ASC/DESC）\n\n**响应：**\n- products: 商品列表\n- total: 总数量\n- page: 当前页码\n- pageSize: 每页数量"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 获取商品详情",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/products/3",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["products", "3"]
            },
            "description": "根据商品ID获取详细信息\n\n**路径参数：**\n- id: 商品ID\n\n**响应：**\n- 商品完整信息\n- 卖家信息（id, username, email, avatar）"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 创建商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"iPhone 14 Pro 256GB\",\n  \"description\": \"深空黑色，99新，无磕碰，原装配件齐全，还在保修期内。因换新机出售。\",\n  \"price\": 5999,\n  \"category\": \"数码产品\",\n  \"condition\": \"like_new\",\n  \"images\": [\n    \"http://localhost:3001/uploads/product_1776094862987.png\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/products",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["products"]
            },
            "description": "发布新商品\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**请求参数：**\n- title: 商品标题（必填，1-100字符）\n- description: 商品描述（可选）\n- price: 价格（必填，大于0.01）\n- category: 分类（必填）\n- condition: 成色（必填：new/like_new/good/fair）\n- images: 图片URL数组（可选）\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 201\n- data: 创建的商品信息"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.4 更新商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"iPhone 14 Pro 256GB（降价）\",\n  \"price\": 5699,\n  \"description\": \"深空黑色，99新，无磕碰，原装配件齐全。急售，价格可议。\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/products/13",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["products", "13"]
            },
            "description": "更新商品信息（仅卖家本人可操作）\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**路径参数：**\n- id: 商品ID\n\n**请求参数：**\n- 可更新字段：title, description, price, category, condition, images\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 200\n- data: 更新后的商品信息"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.5 删除商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/products/13",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["products", "13"]
            },
            "description": "删除商品（软删除，仅卖家本人可操作）\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**路径参数：**\n- id: 商品ID\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 200\n- message: 商品删除成功"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.6 获取我的商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/products/my?status=available",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["products", "my"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "available",
                  "description": "筛选状态（可选）"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取当前用户发布的所有商品\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**查询参数：**\n- status: 商品状态（可选）\n\n**响应：**\n- 商品列表"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "商品管理相关接口，包括商品的增删改查"
    },
    {
      "name": "3. 订单模块 (Orders)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 创建订单",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": 5\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/orders",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "创建购买订单\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**请求参数：**\n- productId: 商品ID（必填）\n\n**业务逻辑：**\n1. 检查商品是否存在且可购买\n2. 检查是否为自己的商品（不能购买自己的商品）\n3. 创建订单并将商品状态改为 sold\n4. 使用事务保证数据一致性\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 201\n- data: 订单详情（包含商品、买家、卖家信息）"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 获取我的订单（买家）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/orders/buyer?status=pending",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "buyer"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "pending",
                  "description": "订单状态（可选）"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "获取我作为买家的订单列表\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**查询参数：**\n- status: 订单状态（pending/completed/cancelled）\n\n**响应：**\n- 订单列表（包含商品和卖家信息）"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 获取我的订单（卖家）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/orders/seller",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "seller"]
            },
            "description": "获取我作为卖家的订单列表\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**响应：**\n- 订单列表（包含商品和买家信息）"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.4 获取订单详情",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/orders/7",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "7"]
            },
            "description": "获取订单详细信息\n\n**需要认证：** 是（仅买家或卖家可查看）\n\n**路径参数：**\n- id: 订单ID\n\n**响应：**\n- 订单完整信息（包含商品、买家、卖家）"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.5 完成订单",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/orders/7/complete",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "7", "complete"]
            },
            "description": "标记订单为已完成（仅买家可操作）\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**路径参数：**\n- id: 订单ID\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 200\n- data: 更新后的订单信息"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3.6 取消订单",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/orders/7/cancel",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "7", "cancel"]
            },
            "description": "取消订单（买家或卖家均可操作）\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**路径参数：**\n- id: 订单ID\n\n**业务逻辑：**\n1. 检查订单状态（只能取消 pending 状态的订单）\n2. 更新订单状态为 cancelled\n3. 将商品状态恢复为 available\n4. 使用事务保证数据一致性\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 200\n- data: 更新后的订单信息"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "订单管理相关接口，包括创建、查询、完成、取消订单"
    },
    {
      "name": "4. 文件上传 (Upload)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 上传图片",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{TOKEN}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "图片文件"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/upload/image",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["upload", "image"]
            },
            "description": "上传商品图片\n\n**需要认证：** 是\n\n**请求参数：**\n- file: 图片文件（form-data）\n\n**限制：**\n- 文件类型：jpg, jpeg, png, gif\n- 文件大小：最大 5MB\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 201\n- data.url: 图片访问URL\n- data.filename: 文件名\n\n**注意：**\n- 图片存储在 backend/uploads/ 目录\n- 通过 /uploads/:filename 访问"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "文件上传相关接口"
    },
    {
      "name": "5. 系统接口 (System)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "5.1 健康检查",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/health",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "检查服务器是否正常运行\n\n**响应：**\n- code: 200\n- message: OK"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "系统相关接口"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 全局前置脚本",
          "console.log('请求 URL:', pm.request.url.toString());",
          "console.log('请求方法:', pm.request.method);"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 全局测试脚本",
          "pm.test('响应时间小于 2000ms', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
          "});",
          "",
          "pm.test('响应格式为 JSON', function () {",
          "    pm.response.to.have.header('Content-Type');",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "BASE_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001/api",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API 基础地址"
    },
    {
      "key": "TOKEN",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT Token（登录后自动保存）"
    }
  ]
}
